OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain quickly
OL,6,Fclears away northeast, then drier for
OL,7,Fa time in the evening before further
OL,8,Foutbreaks of heavy rain arrive. Windy
OL,9,Feverywhere with southerly gales along
OL,10,Fthe Angus coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,13,Ffrequent showers, some heavy. A very
OL,14,Fwindy day too with southwesterly gales.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,17,Fspells and scattered showers on
OL,18,FWednesday then mainly dry and bright
OL,19,Fon Thursday and Friday. Feeling mild,
OL,20,Fbut breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
